      ["ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ","tinn kitābā̃","three books","ਕਿਤਾਬ → ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ: feminine nouns ending in a consonant add -ਾਂ."],
      ["ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਉੱਤੇ ਹੈ।","kitāb mez utte hai.","The book is on the table.","ਉੱਤੇ (on) comes after the noun."],
      ["ਬੱਤੀ ਬੰਦ ਕਰ ਦਿਓ।","battī band kar dio.","Please turn off the light.","ਬੱਤੀ (light) is feminine. On: ਬੱਤੀ ਜਗਾ ਦਿਓ."],
      ["ਮੈਂ ਖਾਣਾ ਬਣਾ ਰਹੀ ਹਾਂ।","maĩ khāṇā baṇā ráhī hā̃.","I'm cooking. (a woman speaking)","ਰਹੀ agrees with the speaker. A man says ਬਣਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ."],
      ["ਮੈਂ ਕੱਪੜੇ ਧੋ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ।","maĩ kappṛe dhò ríhā hā̃.","I'm washing clothes. (a man speaking)","ਕੱਪੜੇ (clothes) is masculine plural."],
      ["ਉਹ ਸੌਂ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ।","úh saũ ríhā hai.","He is sleeping.","For a woman: ਉਹ ਸੌਂ ਰਹੀ ਹੈ."],
      ["ਬੱਚੇ ਟੀਵੀ ਦੇਖ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ।","bacche ṭīvī dekh ráhe han.","The kids are watching TV.","Plural subject: ਰਹੇ ਹਨ."]
