      ["ਉਹ ਕੁੜੀ ਬਹੁਤ ਚੰਗੀ ਹੈ।","úh kuṛī báhut changī hai.","That girl is very nice.","ਕੁੜੀ is feminine, so ਚੰਗੀ, even after ਹੈ."],
      ["ਇਹ ਕਮੀਜ਼ ਉਸ ਨਾਲੋਂ ਸਸਤੀ ਹੈ।","íh kamīz us nālõ sastī hai.","This shirt is cheaper than that one.","ਕਮੀਜ਼ is feminine, so ਸਸਤੀ. No word for \"more\" is needed."],
      ["ਇਹ ਸਭ ਤੋਂ ਵਧੀਆ ਹੈ।","íh sábh tõ vádhīā hai.","This is the best.","ਸਭ ਤੋਂ = \"than all\". ਵਧੀਆ does not change."]
