      ["In ਚਾਹ ਲੱਸੀ ਨਾਲੋਂ ਸਸਤੀ ਹੈ, why ਸਸਤੀ?",["It agrees with ਲੱਸੀ","It agrees with ਚਾਹ, the thing described","ਸਸਤੀ never changes","Comparisons are always feminine"],1,"The adjective agrees with the thing being described: ਚਾਹ is feminine."],
      ["What does ਸਭ ਤੋਂ ਵੱਡਾ mean?",["bigger","very big","not big","the biggest"],3,"ਸਭ ਤੋਂ, 'than all', makes the most: the biggest."]
